  // "Daryl Javier" and "Daryl Aquino". Book Session refused every one, but only after a wasted turn. The requester's own
  // words are read here - "engineer Drey", "engineer: Drey", "the engineer is Drey", "engineered by Drey", "Drey is
  // engineering", the same for the arranger - and matched against Bookers: full name, first name, a "Goes by" alias, or
